    598  f660							; PhHcrEntry — PhaseBlink $82 (hcrunch) tramp target.
    599  f660							; Contract (user decision 2026-10-19): the crunch band is ALWAYS band 1,
    600  f660							; ALWAYS hot, ALWAYS the same geometry — a fixed 10-cell prefix (half the
    601  f660							; playfield width). The record fields x/band/w/h are IGNORED; the $82
    602  f660							; class byte and the 5-byte stride stay only so the walker is untouched.
    603  f660							; PF band1 = P(n), n = HcrClock(10): the prefix rows are entirely covered
    604  f660							; by the crunch, so the prefix mask is the whole row (no AND pass).
    605  f660							; IN: Y = record base, FetchPtr unused. OUT: Y = base+4 (.PhRec contract).
    606  f660							; Clobbers A/X/Y + CollisionX (HcrClock scratch); no stack use.
