    818  fc69							; set it this overscan) → blank all band gates so the cave renders no
    819  fc69							; strip; the pack below then emits mask 0 → every overlay stays
    820  fc69							; transparent too. BandTab restages from ROM next room entry. ---
    821  fc69		       a5 ba		      lda	EnemyDeadMask
    822  fc6b		       29 08		      and	#$08
