    932  fcbc							; (staged $8E != 0), 0 = symmetric. Cave never
    933  fcbc							; writes $8F; bank1 HUD entry copies it to LineCount ($84 — cave .Row
    934  fcbc							; clobbers it) before overscan PHM reads. BallX in Temp stays raw (the
    935  fcbc							; kernel's ball block reads it later this VBL).
    936  fcbc							; b3 seeds BEFORE the Temp=0 early-out so an M1-ONLY room still packs
